IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-QUIP-PRO.

DATA DIVISION.
01 DIM-D               PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 CODEBOOK-SIZE       PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 SNR-DB              PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 THROUGHPUT-TOKS     PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-QUIP-PRO.
    IF DIM-D == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    IF CODEBOOK-SIZE == 0
        MOVE 256 TO CODEBOOK-SIZE.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 53 TO SNR-DB.
    MOVE 8600 TO THROUGHPUT-TOKS.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 DIM-D.
    WEIGHT 30 THROUGHPUT-TOKS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
